        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Physicians misdiagnose $ ^{5} $ disordered $ ^{4} $ thought $ ^{3} $ in young $ ^{1} $ children $ ^{2} $ because they are unfamiliar with recent literature on the subject.",
            "block_bbox": [
